{
    "title": "Shimeji",
    "description": "<b>Say goodbye to boredom with your favorite characters right on your screen!</b>  \r\n  \r\n<b>\u2728 Create & Customize with the New Editor!</b>  \r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Unleash Your Creativity!</b> Our new editor lets you create characters from scratch or edit existing ones. You can:  \r\n  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Create a new character</b> by drawing along animation guidelines to bring your own characters to life.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Modify existing characters</b> by erasing parts you don't want and <b>drawing on top</b> to make them truly yours. <b>Undo</b> any mistakes.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Choose any color</b> by using the color picker or use a preset one.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Zoom in</b> for small details by pinching the screen with two fingers.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Import and Export</b> your creations to gallery for those who are advanced artists. Use any drawing app to edit your creations!  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83d\udcf1 Always On-Screen!</b>  \r\nYour characters stay on your screen all the time, no matter what app you\u2019re using. They\u2019re always there to keep you company!  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83d\udce5 Download Hundreds of Characters!</b>  \r\nWhether you're into anime, games, or K-pop, you\u2019ll find your favorite characters here. Choose from <b>hundreds of characters</b> and watch them interact on your screen!  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83c\udf89 Over 100 Super Shimeji Mascots!</b>  \r\n\ud83d\ude80 <b>Bigger & Better!</b> Super Shimeji mascots are <b>16x higher resolution</b> than regular Shimeji, making your screen look amazing! You can <b>edit any Super Shimeji</b> to modify them to your linking.  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83d\udd27 Customize Your Shimeji Experience!</b>  \r\n  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Adjust animation size and speed</b> to make your characters just right for your screen.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Choose up to 6 characters</b> to appear at the same time and <b>switch them randomly</b> for endless fun.  \r\n  \u2022 <b>Pick up and throw</b> your characters around the screen. Play with them however you like!  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83d\udc7b Ghost Mode for when gaming</b>  \r\nWant to keep your characters but need critical touch precision? No problem! Use the <b>Ghost Mode button</b> in your notification to make them <b>transparent and touch-less</b> while gaming or using other apps.  \r\n  \r\n<b>\ud83d\udeab Zero Ads, Just Fun!</b>  \r\nEnjoy your screen buddies without any interruptions. We\u2019ve made the decision to keep the app <b>completely ad-free</b> so you can have a fun experience without any distractions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Say goodbye to boredom with your favorite characters right on your screen!</b>  <br>  <br><b>\u2728 Create &amp; Customize with the New Editor!</b>  <br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Unleash Your Creativity!</b> Our new editor lets you create characters from scratch or edit existing ones. You can:  <br>  <br>  \u2022 <b>Create a new character</b> by drawing along animation guidelines to bring your own characters to life.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Modify existing characters</b> by erasing parts you don&#39;t want and <b>drawing on top</b> to make them truly yours. <b>Undo</b> any mistakes.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Choose any color</b> by using the color picker or use a preset one.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Zoom in</b> for small details by pinching the screen with two fingers.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Import and Export</b> your creations to gallery for those who are advanced artists. Use any drawing app to edit your creations!  <br>  <br><b>\ud83d\udcf1 Always On-Screen!</b>  <br>Your characters stay on your screen all the time, no matter what app you\u2019re using. They\u2019re always there to keep you company!  <br>  <br><b>\ud83d\udce5 Download Hundreds of Characters!</b>  <br>Whether you&#39;re into anime, games, or K-pop, you\u2019ll find your favorite characters here. Choose from <b>hundreds of characters</b> and watch them interact on your screen!  <br>  <br><b>\ud83c\udf89 Over 100 Super Shimeji Mascots!</b>  <br>\ud83d\ude80 <b>Bigger &amp; Better!</b> Super Shimeji mascots are <b>16x higher resolution</b> than regular Shimeji, making your screen look amazing! You can <b>edit any Super Shimeji</b> to modify them to your linking.  <br>  <br><b>\ud83d\udd27 Customize Your Shimeji Experience!</b>  <br>  <br>  \u2022 <b>Adjust animation size and speed</b> to make your characters just right for your screen.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Choose up to 6 characters</b> to appear at the same time and <b>switch them randomly</b> for endless fun.  <br>  \u2022 <b>Pick up and throw</b> your characters around the screen. Play with them however you like!  <br>  <br><b>\ud83d\udc7b Ghost Mode for when gaming</b>  <br>Want to keep your characters but need critical touch precision? No problem! Use the <b>Ghost Mode button</b> in your notification to make them <b>transparent and touch-less</b> while gaming or using other apps.  <br>  <br><b>\ud83d\udeab Zero Ads, Just Fun!</b>  <br>Enjoy your screen buddies without any interruptions. We\u2019ve made the decision to keep the app <b>completely ad-free</b> so you can have a fun experience without any distractions.",
